\par\par \uc2 Business/Financial Desk; SECTB\par \b \uc2 Amazon\uc2  Prime Set to Stream Trump's Show 'Apprentice'\b0\par\par\uc2 By John Koblin \par \uc2 426 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 March 2025\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The company said it would release several seasons of the reality show showcasing \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2  before he turned to politics.\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  is deepening its relationship with President Trump.\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  Prime Video announced on Monday that multiple seasons of ''The Apprentice,'' the 2000s reality series that helped raise Mr. Trump's profile on a national stage, would soon be available on the streaming service.\par \par \uc2 The show's first season, which premiered in 2004, is available on Prime Video starting Monday. \uc2 Amazon\uc2  said that a new season of ''The Apprentice'' would be made available each week, culminating with the show's seventh season, which will make its debut to the streaming service in late April.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump expressed his enthusiastic approval in a statement released by \uc2 Amazon\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ''I look forward to watching this show myself -- such great memories, and so much fun, but most importantly, it was a learning experience for all of us!'' he said.\par \par \uc2 This is the second prominent deal that \uc2 Amazon\uc2  has made with the Trump family this year. In January, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  announced that it would release a ''behind the scenes'' documentary about Melania Trump, the first lady. Mrs. Trump will be an executive producer of the documentary, and \uc2 Amazon\uc2  said at the time that it was ''excited to share this truly unique story.''\par \par \uc2 Jeff Bezos\uc2 , \uc2 Amazon\uc2 's founder, said late last year that he was ''very optimistic'' about the incoming Trump administration. Like other tech giants and Silicon Valley companies, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  donated $1 million to Mr. Trump's inaugural fund.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Bezos also owns The \uc2 Washington Post\uc2 , which has been going through a prolonged period of tumult, including after Mr. Bezos decided not to have the paper endorse a candidate in the 2024 presidential election. Mr. Bezos is retooling the paper's opinion section, which he said would emphasize ''personal liberties and free markets.''\par \par \uc2 ''The Apprentice'' was a hit for NBC when it debuted in 2004, though the show's ratings lost steam over time.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump was an executive producer of the show, and as a result he would almost certainly receive compensation from the new deal with \uc2 Amazon\uc2 . A spokesman for the company declined to comment on financial arrangements.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, Mark Burnett, the reality show mogul who served as an executive producer of ''The Apprentice,'' expressed his excitement over the new streaming deal.\par \par \uc2 '''The Apprentice' is one of the best shows that I ever produced,'' Mr. Burnett said in a statement released by \uc2 Amazon\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020250311el3b0003o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
