\par\par \uc2 National Desk; SECTA\par \b \uc2 Layoffs at Safety Agency Investigating Musk's Cars\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jack Ewing \par \uc2 525 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 February 2025\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 24\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Highway Traffic Safety Administration\uc2  has laid off 4 percent of its workers, a transportation official said. The agency has raised questions about crashes involving \uc2 Tesla\uc2 's self-driving technology.\par \par \uc2 The federal agency responsible for traffic safety, which has been investigating whether self-driving technology in \uc2 Tesla\uc2  vehicles played a role in the death of a pedestrian, laid off 4 percent of its employees last week, a Transportation Department spokesperson said Saturday.\par \par \uc2 The traffic safety agency did not say whether any of its fired employees were involved in investigations of \uc2 Tesla\uc2 , whose chief executive, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , is leading a team at the so-called Department of Government Efficiency established by President Trump.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Musk's team has been forcing layoffs at numerous government agencies as part of an effort to reshape the federal bureaucracy. Mr. Musk has retained control of \uc2 Tesla\uc2  while spending much of his time in Washington.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Highway Traffic Safety Administration\uc2  has three active investigations of \uc2 Tesla\uc2 , according to agency documents, including one examining whether the company's autonomous driving software is prone to failure when visibility is poor.\par \par \uc2 The layoffs at the traffic safety agency, which has less than 1,000 employees, were reported earlier by \uc2 The Washington Post\uc2 . Even after the layoffs, the agency continues to employ more people than at the beginning of the Biden administration, the agency said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 ''The last administration grew \uc2 NHTSA\uc2  by a whopping 30 percent,'' the agency said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 ''We have retained positions critical to the mission of saving lives, preventing injuries, and reducing economic costs due to road traffic crashes,'' the agency said. ''We will continue to enforce the law on all manufacturers of motor vehicles and equipment.''\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2  did not respond to a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 One of the investigations into \uc2 Tesla\uc2  is based on four accidents involving technology that the carmaker calls supervised full self-driving, which can steer, brake and navigate \uc2 Tesla\uc2  cars in some situations. In one of the crashes, a \uc2 Tesla\uc2  struck and killed a pedestrian, according to agency documents. In another of the accidents, a person was injured.\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2 's self-driving technology relies on cameras to survey a car's surroundings, in contrast with competitors like \uc2 Waymo\uc2 , a unit of the same company as \uc2 Google\uc2 , that also uses lasers and radar to recognize objects.\par \par \uc2 The traffic safety agency has been looking into whether \uc2 Tesla\uc2 's technology failed when visibility was poor because of glare from the sun, fog or dust.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Musk has often argued that \uc2 Tesla\uc2  self-driving technology is safer than human drivers.\par \par \uc2 The technology is also crucial to \uc2 Tesla\uc2 's future and share price. As \uc2 Tesla\uc2  sales have flagged, falling 1 percent last year even as the global market for electric vehicles rose 25 percent, Mr. Musk has shifted the company's focus to autonomous driving technology and plans for a self-driving taxi.\par \par \uc2 The technology will help make \uc2 Tesla\uc2  the most valuable company in the world by far, Mr. Musk told investors last month.\par \par \uc2 Mark Walker contributed reporting.\par \par \uc2 Mark Walker contributed reporting.\par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020250223el2n0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
